COPY &1 PASCAL A = BACKUP A (REPLACE OLDDATE
FILEDEF * CLEAR
FILEDEF OUTPUT TERMINAL (RECFM V LRECL 132
FILEDEF EINGABE DISK &1 BACKUP (RECFM F LRECL 80
FILEDEF AUSGABE DISK &1 NEU
FILEDEF LISTING DISK &1 LISTING
EXEC PASRUNM PASFORM
FILEDEF IN DISK &1 NEU
FILEDEF OUT DISK &1 PASCAL (RECFM FB LRECL 80 BLOCK 800
MOVE IN OUT
